    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the Python file `embed_batch.py` that generates embeddings for a batch of texts using a concrete external provider, I need to choose a specific service. For this task, I will use the Amazon Bedrock service, which is a suitable choice for generating embeddings. The code will include the necessary imports and API calls to interact with the Amazon Bedrock service. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
